      "raw": "Saw this game in my FLGS today, picked it up and I'm in love.  Finally the gateway game for my wife.  Thank you SOM!!!\n\nOn to the question:\n\nIt involves the order of effects when Wraith plays Throat Jab against Baron Blade with Backlash Field up.  After Wraith deals damage, does she suffer from the 3 points returned from Backlash before the Throat Jabs second effect, target cannot deal damage until the start of Wraith's next turn, or does the no damage effect take place prior to the Backlash smacking her?\n\nReading through the forums, I suspect...Wraith does damage, Backlash does damage, Baron no longer can damage until the start of Wraith's next turn, but I want to be sure.\n\nThanks!",
