      "created_at": "2012-04-08T03:20:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think your assessment is correct. The effects of Throat Jab are written as two different sentences, so since the Backlash Field is triggered by the first sentence, I believe it would go off before The Wraith’s second sentence takes effect.</p>",
