      "cooked": "<p>... Which makes like no sense, since he's ELECTRIFYING her, which shouldn't expend physical effort...</p><p>Honestly, the Backlash Field should be a device, with its own HP. It would make a lot more sense, given its purpose as a distraction. His whole deck is distractions; giving the player the option of hitting Blade to stop the moon from hitting the Earth or hitting the shocky wall thing that keeps hurting you makes a lot of sense, given his deck.</p>",
