    {
      "id": 26962,
      "name": "thad",
      "username": "thad",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/48db29/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-12-18T21:25:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah I tend to agree that the backlash field would have been better served as a target device so that it delt it's own damage (it definitely makes more sense :)).&nbsp; I also noticed after I made the post that in the rules FAQ, further down, it mentions the throat jab/backlash field scenario specifically and basically states what I just said, so I think we can call this case closed  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"> .</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
