    {
      "id": 26965,
      "name": "Ronway",
      "username": "Ronway",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-12-18T21:56:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"McBehrer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/48/1850_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> McBehrer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>but, she has to go THROUGH the field to GET TO HIM. So, really, she should get shocked BEFORE she hits the button…&nbsp;And that's a stupid excuse, anyway.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Backlash Field is reactive, not something that is constantly there. If you read the FFA#1, Wraith kicks him and then the Backlash triggers. Also the name, Backlash kind of gives that away.</p>\n<p>Fun fact, if Backlash Field was actually a target, it would be much easier to get rid of because anyone that deals damage can destroy it and not requiring Ongoing Destruction.</p>",
      "post_number": 10,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:00:55.572Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 5585,
      "topic_slug": "throat-jab-vs-backlash-field",
      "display_username": "Ronway",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
      "flair_bg_color": "",
      "flair_color": "",
      "flair_group_id": 41,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"McBehrer\"]\n\nbut, she has to go THROUGH the field to GET TO HIM. So, really, she should get shocked BEFORE she hits the button...&nbsp;And that&#39;s a stupid excuse, anyway.\n\n[/quote]\n\nBacklash Field is reactive, not something that is constantly there. If you read the FFA#1, Wraith kicks him and then the Backlash triggers. Also the name, Backlash kind of gives that away.\n\nFun fact, if Backlash Field was actually a target, it would be much easier to get rid of because anyone that deals damage can destroy it and not requiring Ongoing Destruction.\n",
